  "identifier": "SEMseeker",
  "name": "SEMseeker: Stochastic Epigenetic Mutations SEM Seeker",
  "description": "Detection, quantification and association analysis of Stochastic Epigenetic Mutations (SEMs) from DNA methylation data: Illumina methylation arrays (EPIC 850k, 450k, 27k), bisulfite sequencing (WGBS / RRBS) and long-read sequencing (Oxford Nanopore, PacBio). Computes binary SEM calls and continuous deviation metrics, aggregates mutations into genomic lesions, and provides association analysis and pathway enrichment.",
